(7158680, 1098885, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love what you were going for here!  You''ve made a really good capture of motion.<br/> <br/>But... what I think is lacking is... the detail in the liquid in the glass.   <br/> <br/>On my monitor it appears as ... blackness.  <br/> <br/>It leaves me wanting... more. <br/> <br/>*sigh*<br/> <br/>(commenting only)<br/> <br/>Edit to add:   I''ve found "more"!  <br/> <br/>Look at: "Crystal Blue Persuasion"   They left the "blue" in the glass.<br/> <br/>I don''t know how... I can''t do what you''ve done... I don''t do motion well, but... see the photog on that image for tips if you want to grow in what you obviously are interested in.<br/> <br/>I love your composition... just get the technique.   <br/> <br/>And... <br/> <br/>Then teach me.  <br/> <br/>:D</td>', 'I love what you were going for here!  You''ve made a really good capture of motion. But... what I think is lacking is... the detail in the liquid in the glass.    On my monitor it appears as ... blackness.   It leaves me wanting... more.  *sigh* (commenting only) Edit to add:   I''ve found "more"!   Look at: "Crystal Blue Persuasion"   They left the "blue" in the glass. I don''t know how... I can''t do what you''ve done... I don''t do motion well, but... see the photog on that image for tips if you want to grow in what you obviously are interested in. I love your composition... just get the technique.    And...  Then teach me.   :D', '2014-01-17 00:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
