(7159682, 1098384, 173844, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I like it.  The blues and yellows work so well together.  The atmosphere, with that bit of fog at the far end of the bridge, is beguiling.  The people are well-situated.  And what a puddle!</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I like it.  The blues and yellows work so well together.  The atmosphere, with that bit of fog at the far end of the bridge, is beguiling.  The people are well-situated.  And what a puddle!', '2014-01-19 11:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
