(7161174, 1098772, 65234, '<td valign="top">My fave of the challenge!  Possibly influenced by the fact that I have a granddaughter who''s close to walking, and I can''t wait to see her express joy like this.  Makes me feel all warm and fuzzy :-). Little bit of motion blur, beautiful reflection, and ... joy.</td>', 'My fave of the challenge!  Possibly influenced by the fact that I have a granddaughter who''s close to walking, and I can''t wait to see her express joy like this.  Makes me feel all warm and fuzzy :-). Little bit of motion blur, beautiful reflection, and ... joy.', '2014-01-22 15:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161175, 1098956, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  The sky promises a beautiful day after the fog clears, and there is much to see in the mountains already.</td>', 'Gorgeous!  The sky promises a beautiful day after the fog clears, and there is much to see in the mountains already.', '2014-01-22 15:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161176, 1097964, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, and the tranquility.</td>', 'Love the composition, and the tranquility.', '2014-01-22 15:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161177, 1098799, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Some of the youngsters here may never have seen a blue screen of death.  Brings back memories ... although I don''t remember the text on my screen being quite that amusing.</td>', 'LOL!  Some of the youngsters here may never have seen a blue screen of death.  Brings back memories ... although I don''t remember the text on my screen being quite that amusing.', '2014-01-22 15:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161178, 1098861, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love Bluebirds :-))).   Nice detail and complementary background for this boy.  Eye contact is a nice bonus.</td>', 'Love Bluebirds :-))).   Nice detail and complementary background for this boy.  Eye contact is a nice bonus.', '2014-01-22 15:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161180, 1098895, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s kinda'' scary!  Beautiful detail in the blowing snow (assuming that''s what I''m seeing).</td>', 'That''s kinda'' scary!  Beautiful detail in the blowing snow (assuming that''s what I''m seeing).', '2014-01-22 15:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161181, 1098578, 65234, '<td valign="top">He looks kind of lonely; if he''s fighting alone his odds aren''t good unless it''s king vs. king.  Lovely tones here.</td>', 'He looks kind of lonely; if he''s fighting alone his odds aren''t good unless it''s king vs. king.  Lovely tones here.', '2014-01-22 15:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161182, 1098940, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the slinky.  I''m not sure I should, it being a toy and all, but it''s so very nicely lit and reflected.</td>', 'I like the slinky.  I''m not sure I should, it being a toy and all, but it''s so very nicely lit and reflected.', '2014-01-22 15:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161183, 1098921, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sense of motion here.</td>', 'Wonderful sense of motion here.', '2014-01-22 15:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
