(7161189, 1098519, 65234, '<td valign="top">That beak looks SERIOUSLY sharp!  I''d hate to be on his bad side.  Gorgeous bird, though.  Avian eye candy.</td>', 'That beak looks SERIOUSLY sharp!  I''d hate to be on his bad side.  Gorgeous bird, though.  Avian eye candy.', '2014-01-22 15:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
