(7161910, 1098384, 124190, '<td valign="top">TOLD YOU!!!!!!!!!!!!!    even the trolls couldn''t score below a 4.....they would have just been eating away at their own tails.....in envy....chompchompchomp<br/> <br/>I LOVE this shot......aren''t you glad I MADE you go for a walk that night!lololol     <br/> <br/>This is a pivotal turning point in your photography.    This shot combines your keen awareness and desire to be sharp with a subtle atmospheric mood produced by nature, scattered uneven man made lighting and off set composition......ALL work together.   Something for everyone!    ;-)))<br/> <br/>Now let''s go shoot the ice chunks on the river at sunset!!!!!   They are piling up at the Rock Bass Grill....I think you earned your oysters!!!!!</td>', 'TOLD YOU!!!!!!!!!!!!!    even the trolls couldn''t score below a 4.....they would have just been eating away at their own tails.....in envy....chompchompchomp I LOVE this shot......aren''t you glad I MADE you go for a walk that night!lololol      This is a pivotal turning point in your photography.    This shot combines your keen awareness and desire to be sharp with a subtle atmospheric mood produced by nature, scattered uneven man made lighting and off set composition......ALL work together.   Something for everyone!    ;-))) Now let''s go shoot the ice chunks on the river at sunset!!!!!   They are piling up at the Rock Bass Grill....I think you earned your oysters!!!!!', '2014-01-24 09:58:31.000000', NULL, 0),
